<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $1.00-1.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $1.00-1.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderate.</p>
<p>Compared with Wednesday, barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.25</p>
<p>lower. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     54.00</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     53.50-54.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     51.50-53.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     48.00-51.00</p>
<p>Sows - off $0.50-3.00. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  300-400 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>		400-450 lbs    46.50</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>		500-550 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>		550-700 lbs    53.00</p>
</text>
